# horde scene (vector, meters) — obstacle demo for vat_horde
# spawn band at the bottom, goal at the top, a broken wall of buildings with
# two gaps, plus a free-standing diamond block to show the crowd flowing around.
cell 0.5
world 100 70
set k_density 2.5
set k_jam 6

spawn 2 1 96 4
goal 44 66 12 3

# broken barrier at y~33..37: three buildings, two 10 m gaps (at x 30..40, 62..72)
poly 6.0 solid   0 33  30 33  30 37   0 37
poly 6.0 solid  40 33  62 33  62 37  40 37
poly 6.0 solid  72 33 100 33 100 37  72 37

# free-standing diamond (convex) the horde must split around, before the wall
poly 5.0 solid  50 14  60 22  50 30  40 22

# a low muddy patch (passable but costly): triangle, height ~0.3 m
poly 0.3 cost 5.0  14 18  26 18  20 27
